      "Text": "WHAT IT DOES: counts the results of every clash test by status (New, Active, Reviewed, Approved, Resolved), shows the table and saves it as a self-contained HTML page. TO CHANGE: the report title and subtitle, and the file path on Text.WriteToFile.",
